I am an Associate Professor in the Department of Social and Political Sciences at Bocconi University, where I direct the AI in Social Science Research Lab (AISS).
My research studies:

how technological change reshapes labor markets, politics, and demography;
emigration selection at origin;
education;
job amenities.

I am a Research Fellow at CESifo, IZA, the ROCKWOOL Foundation Berlin, the Dondena Centre, IGIER, Baffi Carefin, and the Fondazione Rodolfo DeBenedetti.
